      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Comparing metal roofing and asphalt shingles in Utah depends heavily on your budget, how long you plan to stay in your home, and local climate factors like heavy snow loads on the Wasatch Front or high-elevation areas like Heber City and Park City .",
